OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to resurrect historical  
OL,4,Awalking trail                          
OL,6,FA group is campaigning to revive a     
OL,7,Fhistorical walking route that was cut  
OL,8,Foff by an airfield runway more than 70 
OL,9,Fyears ago.                             
OL,11,FThe Hurstingstone Heritage Trail       
OL,12,Fcampaign aims to re-establish the      
OL,13,Froute, which connected St Ives, Old    
OL,14,FHurst, Woodhurst and Wyton in          
OL,15,FCambridgeshire.                        
OL,17,FCampaigners are calling for            
OL,18,FCambridgeshire County Council to       
OL,19,Freconnect the path, which was cut off  
OL,20,Fwhen RAF Wyton's runway was extended in
OL,21,F1952.                                  
