OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to resurrect historical  
OL,4,Awalking trail                          
OL,6,FAndy Notman, 60, one of the            
OL,7,Fcampaigners, said people had commented 
OL,8,Fthat they would "really enjoy" a route 
OL,9,Flinking the villages.                  
